enant Rights: Rules for Selling a Rental</h1><div class=wsp-kicker>Cash Home Buyers in Michigan</div><div class=wsp-speed><span>Cash Offer in 24 Hours</span></div><ul class=wsp-checks><li>Michigan Landlord Tenant Law and Tenant Rights: inherited, behind on payments, tenants or repairs, we buy the house as-is</li><li>No fees, commissions or closing costs on a Michigan Landlord Tenant Law and Tenant Rights sale</li><li>Turn the Michigan Landlord Tenant Law and Tenant Rights offer down and you owe us nothing</li></ul><h2>Selling a Michigan House? Get a Cash Offer</h2><p>We buy as-is.</p><p><a class='wsp-btn-outline wsp-btn-call' href='tel:424-435-2326'>Call or Text <strong>&nbsp;(424) 435-2326</strong></a></p></div><div class='wsp-hero-right'><iframe src='https://connect.cashhomebuyersca.com/widget/form/zKzKbSeB3aqwWwE8NNxO' data-form-id='zKzKbSeB3aqwWwE8NNxO' title='Cash Offer Form'></iframe><br /><script src='https://connect.cashhomebuyersca.com/js/form_embed.js' async></script></div></div></div><div class='wsp-wrap'><p><em>Last updated November 14, 2026.</em></p><p><strong>Michigan statutes set the basic rules between landlords and tenants, including deposits, notices and what happens when a rental is sold.</strong></p><h2>What the official sources say</h2><ul><li>For damage or other obligation against the deposit, the landlord must mail an itemized notice of damages within 30 days after termination of occupancy, with a check or money order for the difference (or electronic transfer within 10 days after mailing). (MCL 554.609(1)-(3); <a href='https://www.legislature.mi.gov/Laws/MCL?objectName=mcl-554-609' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>source</a>)</li><li>The tenant must respond by mail within 7 days after receipt of the notice of damages or forfeits the amount claimed. (MCL 554.609(4); <a href='https://www.legislature.mi.gov/Laws/MCL?objectName=mcl-554-609' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>source</a>)</li><li>An estate at will may be terminated by 1 month&#x27;s notice; where rent is payable at periods under 3 months, notice equal to the rent interval is sufficient. (MCL 554.134(1); <a href='https://www.legislature.mi.gov/Laws/MCL?objectName=mcl-554-134' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>source</a>)</li><li>Landlord covenants premises and common areas are fit for intended use and in reasonable repair, and complies with health and safety laws, unless disrepair caused by the tenant&#x27;s wilful or irresponsible conduct; parties may modify only if the lease term is at least 1 year. (MCL 554.139(1)-(2); <a href='https://www.legislature.mi.gov/Laws/MCL?objectName=mcl-554-139' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>source</a>)</li></ul><div class=\"chb-cta\" style=\"margin:32px 0;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(120deg,#0F1C2E 0%,#16293F 100%);padding:28px 32px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap;color:#fff;\"><div style=\"max-width:600px;\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:2px;color:#E0A83C;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:6px;\">Selling in Michigan?</div><div style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:20px;line-height:1.35;color:#fff;\">We buy Michigan houses as-is, with no commission, no repairs and no closing costs to you.</div></div><a href=\"#\" onclick=\"var f=document.querySelector('iframe[data-form-id]');if(f){f.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});return false;}\" style=\"flex-shrink:0;padding:14px 24px;border-radius:8px;background:#E0A83C;color:#16203A;font-size:14px;font-weight:800;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap;\">Get My Cash Offer &rarr;</a></div><div class='wsp-related'><div class='wsp-related-grid'><div class='wsp-related-card'><a href='https://cashhomebuyersca.com/michigan-squatters-rights-adverse-possession/'>Michigan Squatters Rights and Adverse Possession</a><p>Official sources.</p></div><div class='wsp-related-card'><a href='https://cash